## 6. HARDWARE WARRANTY AND SUPPORT

**6.1 Limited Hardware Warranty**  
Devs warrants that hardware products will be free from defects in materials and workmanship under normal use for a period of:
- Standard Components: One (1) year from date of purchase
- Premium/Gaming Components: Two (2) years from date of purchase
- Enterprise/Server Components: Three (3) years from date of purchase
- Extended Warranties: Available for purchase separately

**6.2 Warranty Registration**  
To activate extended warranty coverage, you must register your hardware products within thirty (30) days of purchase at devs.com/register.

**6.3 Warranty Exclusions**  
This warranty does not cover:
- Damage caused by accident, abuse, misuse, improper installation, unauthorized modifications, overclocking beyond specified limits, flood, fire, earthquake, lightning, or other external causes
- Damage caused by operating the product outside published specifications or environmental guidelines
- Damage caused by service, repair, or modification performed by unauthorized repair facilities or personnel
- Normal wear and tear including scratches, dents, and cosmetic damage that does not affect functionality
- Products that have been modified, altered, or have had serial numbers removed or defaced
- Consumable parts including thermal paste, fans (after 90 days), and batteries
- Software issues, driver problems, or compatibility issues with third-party products
- Damage caused by improper power supply, electrical surges, or inadequate cooling
- Products used for cryptocurrency mining or other intensive 24/7 operations beyond consumer specifications

**6.4 Warranty Claim Process**  
To make a warranty claim:
1. Contact Devs Technical Support with proof of purchase and serial number
2. Complete the RMA (Return Merchandise Authorization) request form
3. Ship the defective product to Devs' designated service center using provided instructions
4. Devs will inspect the product within 10 business days
5. If claim is approved, product will be repaired or replaced and returned within 30 days

**6.5 Warranty Remedies**  
Your exclusive remedy under this warranty is, at Devs' sole option:
- Repair of the defective hardware product using new or refurbished parts
- Replacement with a new or refurbished product of equal or greater value
- Refund of the purchase price minus a depreciation allowance based on age and usage

**6.6 Advanced Replacement Service**  
Enterprise customers may purchase Advanced Replacement Service, which provides next-business-day shipment of replacement hardware before return of defective products.

**6.7 International Warranty**  
Warranty service is only available in the country of original purchase unless you have purchased International Warranty Coverage. Products must be returned to service centers in the purchase country.

