## 11. TERM AND TERMINATION

**11.1 Term**  
This Agreement remains in effect from the date you first use Licensed Products until terminated by either party as provided herein.

**11.2 Termination by You**  
You may terminate this Agreement at any time by:
- Ceasing all use of Licensed Products
- Uninstalling all software from Authorized Devices
- Destroying or returning all copies in your possession
- Canceling subscription services
- Requesting account deletion at devs.com/account

**11.3 Termination by Devs**  
Devs may terminate this Agreement immediately without notice if you:
- Breach any material term of this Agreement
- Fail to pay fees when due
- Use Licensed Products for illegal purposes
- Engage in license key piracy or distribution
- Misuse Educational Software as described in Section 4
- Damage Devs' reputation or business interests
- Fail to comply with export control regulations

**11.4 Termination for Convenience**  
Devs may terminate licenses for convenience with ninety (90) days' written notice.

**11.5 Effect of Termination**  
Upon termination:
- All license rights immediately cease
- You must immediately stop using Licensed Products
- You must uninstall all software and destroy all copies
- You must return or destroy all Documentation and Confidential Information
- Devs may disable license keys and prevent activation
- Outstanding payment obligations become immediately due
- You remain liable for any breaches occurring before termination

**11.6 Survival**  
The following sections survive termination: Sections 4, 5, 9, 10, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, and 17.

**11.7 No Refund Upon Termination**  
Except as required by law, no refunds will be provided for fees paid prior to termination by Devs.

