## 17. BETA AND PRE-RELEASE SOFTWARE

**17.1 Beta Program**  
Devs may offer access to beta, preview, early access, or pre-release versions of Licensed Products ("Beta Software"). Participation is voluntary and may require separate agreement to beta program terms.

**17.2 Beta Software Characteristics**  
Beta Software:
- May contain bugs, errors, or defects
- May not be feature-complete
- May cause system crashes or data loss
- May be significantly modified before general release
- May never be released commercially
- Is provided for testing and feedback purposes only

**17.3 Additional Restrictions**  
For Beta Software, you agree to:
- Not use in production environments or mission-critical systems
- Not rely on for business operations or critical functions
- Provide feedback and bug reports to Devs
- Not disclose features, performance, or other details publicly without permission
- Accept that Beta Software may be discontinued at any time
- Backup all data before use

**17.4 No Warranty for Beta Software**  
BETA SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITH ALL FAULTS AND WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY WHATSOEVER. ALL WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, ARE DISCLAIMED FOR BETA SOFTWARE.

**17.5 Automatic Expiration**  
Beta Software may automatically cease functioning after an expiration date or upon commercial release.

