## 18. ANTI-CHEAT AND FAIR PLAY COMPLIANCE

**18.1 Gaming Industry Cooperation**  
Devs respects the gaming industry and fair play principles. We actively cooperate with:
- Game developers and publishers
- Anti-cheat solution providers
- Gaming platform operators
- Esports organizations
- Law enforcement agencies investigating gaming-related fraud

**18.2 Detection and Reporting**  
Devs may implement systems to:
- Detect misuse of Educational Software in gaming contexts
- Report violations to affected game publishers
- Share detection signatures with anti-cheat providers
- Participate in industry-wide anti-cheat initiatives

**18.3 License Revocation for Cheating**  
If you use any Licensed Product to cheat in games, your licenses will be:
- Immediately and permanently revoked without refund
- Reported to relevant gaming platforms and publishers
- Added to industry-wide ban databases where applicable

**18.4 No Liability for Game Bans**  
Devs is not responsible for any bans, suspensions, or penalties imposed by game publishers, platforms, or anti-cheat systems resulting from your misuse of Licensed Products.

