## 19. AUDIT RIGHTS

**19.1 Compliance Audits**  
Devs reserves the right to audit your use of Licensed Products to ensure compliance with this Agreement. Audits may include:
- Review of installation records and license deployment
- Inspection of systems using Licensed Products
- Verification of license key usage
- Assessment of compliance with usage restrictions

**19.2 Audit Process**  
Devs will:
- Provide at least thirty (30) days' written notice (except in cases of suspected fraud)
- Conduct audits during normal business hours
- Use qualified third-party auditors bound by confidentiality
- Minimize disruption to your operations

**19.3 Audit Cooperation**  
You agree to:
- Provide reasonable access to systems and records
- Cooperate fully with audit procedures
- Provide accurate and complete information
- Remedy any non-compliance within thirty (30) days

**19.4 Audit Findings**  
If an audit reveals:
- Under-licensing: You must purchase additional licenses within fifteen (15) days
- Over 5% non-compliance: You pay for unlicensed copies plus audit costs
- Willful violations: Devs may terminate all licenses and pursue legal action

